<title>USA: Lenexa, Kan., won by NationsBank West.</title>
<headline>Lenexa, Kan., won by NationsBank West.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>NationsBank West, formerly Boatmen's National Bank of St Louis, said it won $4 million of Lenexa, Kan., general obligation temporary notes, series 1997, with a net interest cost of 4.275 percent.</p>
